        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-2341_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-2341_47426_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-92_46909_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource">Original value: N</link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-219_47413_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>Schedule Page: 220 Line No.: 1 Column: e</b></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Stingray uses the fixed asset method to account for gas owed to the system. This footnote also applies to line 5, column (e).</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-836_46999_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b style="font-weight: bold">Schedule Page: 313 Line No.: 1 Column: c</b></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">The volumes include discounted reservation contract quantities and commodity transactions.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-902_47002_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: 700">Schedule Page: 520 Line No.: 20 Column: c</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: unset">For the purpose of the Annual Charge Adjustment ("ACA") calculation, </span></span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">the throughput volume is 3,413,077 Dth as represented on line 20. No additional volumes are needed to calculate total volumes eligible for the ACA surcharge.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-943_47011_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important">Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: f</span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br /></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important"><span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important">The basis for valuing the gas reported in columns (f), (g), and (h) is the weighted average rate for system gas.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1057_47010_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important; text-decoration: inherit"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit">Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: e</span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br /></span></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit">The allocation</span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"><span style="text-decoration: inherit"> is derived </span></span></span></span><span style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: unset"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit">by determining whether the reservation rate charged within the billing system is discounted, negotiated </span></span></span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit">or recourse. This determination is applied to the retained fuel charged per contract scheduled path, and a pro rata is derived and applied to all volumes and dollars.</span></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: inherit; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: unset; text-decoration: inherit"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: unset"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit">This footnote also applies to column (e), lines 14, 22, 30, 37, 51 and 65.</span></span></span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2092_47193_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>Schedule Page: 219 Line No.: 17.1 Column: c</b></span></span></p><p><img src="data:image/gif;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" width="auto" height="auto" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 1410px; min-height: 0" alt="" /> </p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2113_47192_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><img src="data:image/gif;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" width="auto" height="auto" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 1410px; min-height: 0" alt="" /> </p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2140_47194_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b style="font-weight: bold">Schedule Page: 336 Line No.: 10 Column: b</b></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">General plant is depreciated on a straight line basis per assigned FERC rates.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2146_47196_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b style="font-weight: bold">Schedule Page: 338 Line No.: 6 Column: c</b></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Offshore Transmission Plant has a depreciation rate of 1.35%. Offshore Transmission Plant is also subject to a negative salvage rate of 1.57%. Rates were approved in Docket<span><span> </span></span></span></span><span style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: unset">RP11-1957-005.</span></span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2147_47197_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700">Schedule Page: 338 Line No.: 7 Column: c</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Onshore Transmission Plant has a depreciation rate of 1.35%. Onshore Transmission Plant is also subject to a negative salvage rate of 1.57%. Rates were approved in Docket</span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span><span> </span></span></span></span><span style="background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: unset">RP11-1957-005.</span></span></span> </p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2149_47195_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b style="font-weight: bold">Schedule Page: 338 Line No.: 6 Column: b</b></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">The depreciation plant bases reflect the balances as of 12/31/2025. This footnote also applies to lines 7, 8 and 9, column (b).</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2157_47198_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"><b style="font-weight: bold">Schedule Page: 338 Line No.: 9 Column: c</b></span></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit">The applied depreciation rates for Intangible assets range from 4.5% to 20%.</span></span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
